+{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODUxMjQ2","is_bot":false,"login":"dbeallor","name":""},"body":"Replace the \"Best Albums\" spreadsheet with an app where the user searches an album catalog, ranks favorites per year with cover art, and gets artist and decade lists from Elo ratings built from yearly ranks and head-to-head matchups. The requirements are settled in #2; the other tickets build what it describes.\n\nThis epic is a container. The team builds its child tickets, not the epic itself.\n\n## Tickets\n\n* #2 Write the MVP requirements spec for the album ranking app (first; the build tickets follow it)\n* #3 Choose the tech stack and scaffold the app\n* #4 Define the data model and storage for albums, years and rankings\n* #5 Add album catalog search with cover art\n* #6 Build the per-year ranking screen with drag and drop and covers\n* #7 Build the Elo rating engine and matchup screen\n* #8 Add artist views by decade and overall\n* #9 Add decade top 25 album lists\n* #10 Import the existing spreadsheet\n* #14 Deploy the app with a password gate\n\n","createdAt":"2026-11-20T23:12:52Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDOV2EaVs8AAAADEJXHTQ","name":"type:feature","description":"Type: Feature","color":"1d76db"},{"id":"LA_kwDOV2EaVs8AAAADEJXIXg","name":"agent-skip","description":"Agent team skips this ticket","color":"cccccc"}],"state":"OPEN","title":"Epic: Album ranker MVP"}
